      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The only way to fix what is broken is to stop looking at the mud and start looking at the path forward. You cannot fix the past, but you can choose how you live with the weight of it. The pity in their eyes is not a sign of your failure, but a reflection of the humanity you still hold. You must walk out of the tent and face the living, not the dead.",
